<title>USA: Diebold Inc Q4 shr net up 32 pct to record.</title>
<headline>Diebold Inc Q4 shr net up 32 pct to record.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH CANTON, Ohio 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>(IN THOUSANDS EXCEPT EARNINGS PER SHARE)</p>
<p>				   Fourth Quarter	     Year</p>
<p>				   1996	1995	1996	1995</p>
<p> Net sales		  $294,172 $243,462 $1,030,191 $863,409</p>
<p> Income before taxes	42,541   31,617    146,504  113,223</p>
<p>   PERCENT OF NET SALES   14.46%    13.0%     14.22%   13.11%</p>
<p> Federal, foreign and state</p>
<p>   income taxes	     14,256   10,084     49,079   37,014</p>
<p>   EFFECTIVE TAX RATE     33.51%   31.89%     33.50%   32.69%</p>
<p> Net income		   28,285   21,533     97,425   76,209</p>
<p>   PERCENT OF NET SALES    9.62%    8.84%	9.46%    8.83%</p>
<p> Average number of shares</p>
<p>   outstanding		45,888   45,798     45,864   45,764</p>
<p> Net income per common share</p>
<p>				    0.62     0.47	 2.12     1.67</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
